*
*	Messages for SCCS prt command.
*
-1
"s and i conflict"
You specified both the s and i keyletters.
The i keyletter requests something that the s keyletter inhibits
(the printing of deltas included, excluded or ignored);
hence, the conflict.
-2
"both 'c' and 'r' keyletters specified"
You specified both the c and r keyletters.
The r keyletter prints deltas from beginning of time up to
and including the specified cutoff date, the c keyletter
prints deltas from the specified date up to the present,
hence they are mutually exclusive.
